    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"rest\" that fixes it? like, the well isn't just dry, it's just... gone. it feels like i'm just dragging a hollow shell around. what's the point of even trying to find it again if the world is just gonna keep ignoring it anyway?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
